# Power Automate Action function to remove the last unwanted character in a string.

### Problem
Append variable is used to concatenate a string of users Mentions in Teams (So users get a 'bing' when the message is sent.
The method used to concatenate each mention string with a ',' separator.
The string ends with a ',' which looks strange.
This command is used in a action step to remove the last ',' and append a '.'. 

### Method

- Get length of the string stored in lengthOfteamMentionsVarInit using `length` command.
- Use command `substring` from 0 to length -1 to remove the last unwanted character.
- Use `concat` to append the .


```javascript 
  concat(substring(variables('teamMentionsVar'), 0, sub(variables('lengthOfteamMentionsVarInit'), 1)), '.')
```




